jobs.description:
A leading Spanish organization in the comprehensive logistics sector with over 14,000 people in 21 countries is recruiting talent for their warehouse in Amsterdam.

What are you going to do?
•    Loading/unloading and build of air freight plates;
•    Sorting and scanning the freight;
•    Structure of shipments following the contours manuals and manifest;
•    Processing the air cargo;
•    Forklift activities
•    Keep the workplace nice and tidy;
•    Support the Team Leader in carrying out warehouse activities.

Who are we looking for?
•    Experience with air freight;
•    You are prepared to work in 3 shifts
•    VGB and Air Freight certificate;
•    You are able to speak English;
•    You are willing to work during the weekends.

What do we offer?
•    A competitive salary;
•    Possibility of a permanent contract in long-term;
•    Irregularity shift allowances of at least 35% up to 145% on top of your current hourly salary;
•    Overtime paid (30%) after 40 hours a week;
•    Pension premium free, (paid by employer);
•    8% holiday allowance;
•    Travel allowance of € 0.23 per kilometer;
•    26 paid vacation days per year;
•    An exciting, challenging, and independent job in a dynamic company with a direct and open communication culture and an informal atmosphere.
